msgid "Executes the following weaponskills in succession:<br>1. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Heated Split Shot</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>2. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Heated Slug Shot</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>3. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Heated Clean Shot</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>If any of the weaponskills are not ready, the combo will start again.<br><br>※Action changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Heat Blast</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when firearm is <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Overheated</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
