msgid "Executes the following weaponskills in succession:<br>1. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Fast Blade</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>2. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Riot Blade</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>3. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Royal Authority</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>If any of the weaponskills are not ready, the combo will start again.<br><br>※Action changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Atonement</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Atonement Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>※Action changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Supplication</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Supplication Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>※Action changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sepulchre</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Sepulchre Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
