msgid "Casts the following spells in succession:<br>1. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Fire II in Red</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>200<br>2. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Aero II in Green</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>240<br>3. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Water II in Blue</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>280<br><br>If any of the spells are not ready, the combo will start again."
